 "reference": {
  "id": "l03",
  "url": "https://www.promptsmotion.com/bogdandragomir-35e024",
  "title": "E-reader product intro synced to music",
  "kind": "product intro, 16:9, 15 s",
  "seconds": 15.05,
  "notes": "A single material (a stipple of ink particles) runs the whole film: it dissolves to dither, streams as a cloud, re-forms as icons and returns as the e-reader screen. Fig. plate captions, an editorial serif with an italic key word, numbered spaced-caps eyebrows and a dark-to-paper grade flip at the midpoint. Studied from what the page shows publicly; rebuilt in Moovi's own code (packages/library/src/kits/launch) with our own fonts, sounds and assets."
 },
